As you are walking along with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>, you hear him yawn loudly. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Damn, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$MichaelNickname</span>, this has been sooo boring!”</span> He says bluntly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thought you knew how to have fun?”</span> You apologize for the lack of fun and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> shrugs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. I need to get home. This lame ass day isn’t worth getting grounded for being out past curfew. See you later, lame-o!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> sticks his tongue out at you before walking off. <span style="color:LightCoral">You guess it was a pretty boring hang out session.</span> <br>
